<rml><head><title>RESET SAVED SETTINGS?</title><link type="text/template" href="../../components/dialog.rml" /><link type="text/rcss" href="settings.rcss" /></head><body template="prime-dialog"><div class="settings_dialog"><h1>RESET SAVED SETTINGS?</h1><p>Remove preferences, controls, controller profiles, mappings and HUD profiles. Accounts, saves, game files and downloaded content remain. Defaults activate after restart.</p><div id="settings_video_status"/><div id="settings_video_error"/><div class="dialog_actions"><button id="settings_reset_cancel" class="play_action" data-action="settings:action:9">CANCEL</button><button id="settings_reset_confirm" class="play_action" data-action="settings:action:6">CONFIRM RESET</button></div></div></body></rml>
